column2:
If only you invested a tiny fraction of the effort it took to write this to make it easier for us to read. It's a serious discourtesy.<p>```<p>.reading-container {<p><pre><code>  /\* Automatically caps the container at 65 characters on desktop, 

     but scales to 100% minus a 2rem padding buffer on mobile devices \*/

  width: min(65ch, 100% - 2rem);

  margin-inline: auto;
</code></pre>
}
```
